  "prefLabel": "Nuh 201.01 Rules of Practice and Procedure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nuh 201.01 Rules of Practice and Procedure. The Plc 200 rules shall govern with regards to all procedures for:\n\nAdjudicatory proceedings;\n\n(a) Rulemaking submissions, considerations, and dispositions of rulemaking petitions;\n\n(b) Public comment hearings;\n\n(c) Declaratory rulings;\n\n(d) All statements of policy and interpretation;\n\n(e) Explanation of adopted rules; and\n\n(f) Voluntary surrender of licenses.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Nuh 200) #13934, eff 6-22-24",
